      "content": "That makes sense. I've been seeing some pretty weird spikes in the sensor data though. The salinity readings are jumping around in a way that doesn't align with the temperature trends we'd expect for a stable water mass. It almost looks like the sensor is malfunctioning or catching random noise intermittently. Any idea why we might see those kinds of erratic fluctuations during a descent?",
